# App Store submission screenshots — build output, not source.
#
# tools/capture_screenshots.sh regenerates these by playing the game, and
# nothing in the app or CI reads them. They're ~65 MB of PNGs per capture that
# git can't delta-compress, so committing them would dwarf the rest of the repo
# and grow it again on every refresh. Upload them to App Store Connect (which
# then holds the submitted set) or attach a zip to the GitHub Release.
#
# The much smaller rendered marketing shots in docs/screenshots/*.png ARE
# checked in — the README uses them.
docs/screenshots/appstore/

# Misc
*.log
